{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 221, "line_no": 1, "text": "第七章 民俗文化（一）：生产、饮食、服饰、起居、交通、通讯", "bbox_px": {"x": 394, "y": 145, "w": 1025, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "第七章 民俗文化（一）：生产、饮食、服饰、起居、交通、通讯", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 394, "y": 145, "w": 1025, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 221, "line_no": 2, "text": "到路两旁，以免发生危险，后面的人则紧紧拉住绳子控制速度，稳步行进。", "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 249, "w": 1274, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "到路两旁，以免发生危险，后面的人则紧紧拉住绳子控制速度，稳步行进。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 249, "w": 1274, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 221, "line_no": 3, "text": "滑竿和轿子也是布依族地区曾经流行过的交通工具。过去主要是有钱人、官员和病", "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 314, "w": 1463, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "滑竿和轿子也是布依族地区曾经流行过的交通工具。过去主要是有钱人、官员和病", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 314, "w": 1463, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 221, "line_no": 4, "text": "人乘坐，轿子也用来抬新娘。20世纪50年代以来，除滑竿仍用来抬病人、轿子仍一度用", "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 382, "w": 1544, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "人乘坐，轿子也用来抬新娘。20世纪50年代以来，除滑竿仍用来抬病人、轿子仍一度用", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 382, "w": 1544, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 221, "line_no": 5, "text": "来抬新娘而外，其余情况已不复存在。", "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 451, "w": 655, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "来抬新娘而外，其余情况已不复存在。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 451, "w": 655, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 221, "line_no": 6, "text": "也许最流行的运载方式是肩挑背驮，最流行的交通方式是步行。在山区，这种原始", "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 511, "w": 1463, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "也许最流行的运载方式是肩挑背驮，最流行的交通方式是步行。在山区，这种原始", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 511, "w": 1463, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 221, "line_no": 7, "text": "的方式，随着交通运输的现代化会逐步减轻和改进，却不会消失。至少在相当长的一段", "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 575, "w": 1548, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "的方式，随着交通运输的现代化会逐步减轻和改进，却不会消失。至少在相当长的一段", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 575, "w": 1548, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 221, "line_no": 8, "text": "时间内会是这样。", "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 640, "w": 318, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "时间内会是这样。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 640, "w": 318, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 221, "line_no": 9, "text": "第六节 通讯", "bbox_px": {"x": 736, "y": 797, "w": 350, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "第六节 通讯", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 736, "y": 797, "w": 350, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 221, "line_no": 10, "text": "通讯，指信息沟通。", "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 970, "w": 334, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "通讯，指信息沟通。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 970, "w": 334, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 221, "line_no": 11, "text": "布依族民间至今还有一些传统的信息传递方式，可分为听觉和视觉两种。", "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 1026, "w": 1274, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族民间至今还有一些传统的信息传递方式，可分为听觉和视觉两种。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 1026, "w": 1274, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 221, "line_no": 12, "text": "语言是布依族最古老的通讯方式。要传达某种信息，或通过口头叫喊，或通过某人", "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 1090, "w": 1471, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "语言是布依族最古老的通讯方式。要传达某种信息，或通过口头叫喊，或通过某人", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 1090, "w": 1471, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 221, "line_no": 13, "text": "向信息接受者间接传递。但语言信息的传递有一定局限性，只能在较近的距离内传递，", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 1155, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "向信息接受者间接传递。但语言信息的传递有一定局限性，只能在较近的距离内传递，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 1155, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 221, "line_no": 14, "text": "远距离的间接传递容易造成信息的损耗或变异。", "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 1227, "w": 840, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "远距离的间接传递容易造成信息的损耗或变异。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 1227, "w": 840, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 221, "line_no": 15, "text": "除了语言，布依族中传统的信息传递方式还有击鼓以及行为、物品表征等方式。", "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 1291, "w": 1367, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "除了语言，布依族中传统的信息传递方式还有击鼓以及行为、物品表征等方式。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 1291, "w": 1367, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 221, "line_no": 16, "text": "借助声响来传递信息，如击铜鼓、鸣枪炮、吹牛角等。家中老人寿终、落气时，立即鸣", "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 1356, "w": 1459, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "借助声响来传递信息，如击铜鼓、鸣枪炮、吹牛角等。家中老人寿终、落气时，立即鸣", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 1356, "w": 1459, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 221, "line_no": 17, "text": "放土炮（或火药枪）三响，有的地方则击铜鼓或放鞭炮、吹牛角，表示向全寨人和附近的亲", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 1420, "w": 1540, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "放土炮（或火药枪）三响，有的地方则击铜鼓或放鞭炮、吹牛角，表示向全寨人和附近的亲", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 1420, "w": 1540, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 221, "line_no": 18, "text": "友报丧，也包含向天神报告之意。", "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 1489, "w": 575, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "友报丧，也包含向天神报告之意。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 1489, "w": 575, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 221, "line_no": 19, "text": "若死者女性，则要由孝子向外家报丧，长顺一带，孝子披孝布到外家门前跪下，不", "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 1549, "w": 1467, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "若死者女性，则要由孝子向外家报丧，长顺一带，孝子披孝布到外家门前跪下，不", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 1549, "w": 1467, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 221, "line_no": 20, "text": "进屋，外家即明白何意。", "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 1613, "w": 414, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "进屋，外家即明白何意。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 1613, "w": 414, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 221, "line_no": 21, "text": "女子生头胎，要由族人向外家报喜。其方法是：生男孩则抱一只末成年公鸡去外家，", "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 1678, "w": 1463, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "女子生头胎，要由族人向外家报喜。其方法是：生男孩则抱一只末成年公鸡去外家，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 1678, "w": 1463, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 221, "line_no": 22, "text": "外家则赠一只仔鸡，报喜者将两只鸡一齐带回；同理，生女孩，则抱一只仔鸡去外家，外家", "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 1742, "w": 1548, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "外家则赠一只仔鸡，报喜者将两只鸡一齐带回；同理，生女孩，则抱一只仔鸡去外家，外家", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 1742, "w": 1548, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 221, "line_no": 23, "text": "则赠送一只公鸡。", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 1810, "w": 310, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "则赠送一只公鸡。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 1810, "w": 310, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 221, "line_no": 24, "text": "布依族请媒说亲，男方家请媒人带上几斤蔗糖（称为“走路糖”）到女方家求婚，若女", "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 1860, "w": 1468, "h": 74}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族请媒说亲，男方家请媒人带上几斤蔗糖（称为“走路糖”）到女方家求婚，若女", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 1860, "w": 1468, "h": 74}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 221, "line_no": 25, "text": "方家不同意，就将“走路糖”交给媒人送回男方家。如果同意，就将“走路糖”收下，并请家", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 1935, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "方家不同意，就将“走路糖”交给媒人送回男方家。如果同意，就将“走路糖”收下，并请家", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 1935, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 221, "line_no": 26, "text": "族中数人陪媒人吃饭饮酒，表示婚约已达成，以“吃糖”为证。由于女方家一般不会轻易", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 2000, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "族中数人陪媒人吃饭饮酒，表示婚约已达成，以“吃糖”为证。由于女方家一般不会轻易", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 2000, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 221, "line_no": 27, "text": "应允一桩亲事，同时也为了表明自己女儿的尊贵，同时借机多了解男方及其家庭情况，所", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 2068, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "应允一桩亲事，同时也为了表明自己女儿的尊贵，同时借机多了解男方及其家庭情况，所", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 2068, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 221, "line_no": 28, "text": "以女方家一般开始时都会婉言谢绝，媒人须带上“走路糖”往返多次才能成功，称为“三回", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 2128, "w": 1544, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "以女方家一般开始时都会婉言谢绝，媒人须带上“走路糖”往返多次才能成功，称为“三回", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 2128, "w": 1544, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 221, "line_no": 29, "text": "九转”。“走路糖”便传递了婚姻是否能达成的信息。", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 2189, "w": 917, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "九转”。“走路糖”便传递了婚姻是否能达成的信息。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 2189, "w": 917, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 221, "line_no": 30, "text": "插草标是布依族传递信息的一种特殊方式。生孩子的人家，会在大门口插上草标。", "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 2261, "w": 1467, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "插草标是布依族传递信息的一种特殊方式。生孩子的人家，会在大门口插上草标。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 2261, "w": 1467, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 221, "line_no": 31, "text": "用一根1米多长的茅草，在顶端挽个结，插于门外，有的地方则挂于宅门旁。有的地方用", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 2325, "w": 1544, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "用一根1米多长的茅草，在顶端挽个结，插于门外，有的地方则挂于宅门旁。有的地方用", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 2325, "w": 1544, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 221, "line_no": 32, "text": "竹子或木棍，顶端夹荨麻或辣椒，示意外人勿入。家畜产仔或家中正在举行祭神驱鬼仪", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 2386, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "竹子或木棍，顶端夹荨麻或辣椒，示意外人勿入。家畜产仔或家中正在举行祭神驱鬼仪", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 2386, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
